&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Manuel des races (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Advanced Race Guide, Elves of Golarion, Gnomes of Golarion, Goblins of Golarion, Halflings of Golarion, Humans of Golarion, Dwarves of Golarion, Orcs of Golarion/Manuel des races&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoMR.gif&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;Le personnage se pr&#233;occupe plus de survie que de victoire.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Conditions.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Halfelin.html&quot; title=&quot;Les halfelins&quot;&gt;Halfelin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Avantages.&lt;/b&gt; Quand le personnage se &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Actions-Simples#Combatsurladefensive.html&quot; title=&quot;combat sur la d&#233;fensive&quot;&gt;bat sur la d&#233;fensive&lt;/a&gt; ou utilise la &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Actions-Simples#Defensetotale.html&quot; title=&quot;d&#233;fense totale&quot;&gt;d&#233;fense totale&lt;/a&gt;, son bonus d’esquive &#224; la &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Valeurs-De-Combat#Ca.html&quot; title=&quot;CA&quot;&gt;CA&lt;/a&gt; augmente de 2.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Pathfinder unchained (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Pathfinder unchained&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoPU.png&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;separator&quot;&gt;Astuce martiale (&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Endurance-Et-Astuces-Martiales.html&quot; title=&quot;Endurance et Astuces martiales&quot;&gt;r&#232;gles&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;a class=&quot;headeranchor&quot; id=&quot;Astuce_martiale__r&#232;gles__0&quot; href=&quot;#Astuce_martiale__r&#232;gles__0&quot; title=&quot;Link to this Section&quot; style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Quand le personnage ne &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Actions-Simples#Combatsurladefensive.html&quot; title=&quot;combat sur la d&#233;fensive&quot;&gt;combat pas sur la d&#233;fensive&lt;/a&gt; et n’utilise pas la &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Actions-Simples#Defensetotale.html&quot; title=&quot;d&#233;fense totale&quot;&gt;d&#233;fense totale&lt;/a&gt;, il peut d&#233;penser 5 points d’endurance pour augmenter son bonus d’esquive de 2. Cet accroissement dure jusqu’au d&#233;but de son prochain tour.
